  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Moldova - Support the national system in Moldova to provide protection, education, health, and essential social services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral activities - UNICEF Moldova - Funding to support strengthening of Moldova&#x2019;s national systems to deliver inclusive, quality protection, education, health, and social services to Ukrainian refugee and vulnerable Moldovan children and their families. The project supports the humanitarian-development-peace nexus and aligns with Moldova&#x2019;s EU accession and social policy reform processes. It emphasizes sustainability, inclusion, and resilience, particularly through the RESTART reform and Temporary Protection mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
